  "review_notes": [
    "quick-journey-79: integration_reserve_owner can outlast the CLI's 30s request timeout while train recovery fetches origin. It now answers within a bounded window and, past it, returns the declared success outcome running with operation_id and a poll command; repeating the request joins the run in flight or collects its result.",
    "Only the outcome set changes: running is added as a success. Arguments, result model (IntegrationOperationalValue already carries operation_id), effect, principal and resource gates are unchanged, so transport definitions and the CLI catalogue keep their recorded digests.",
    "No shipped or reviewed playbook references integration_reserve_owner, so no reviewed bundle fingerprint moves."
  ],
